            "review_title": "Review at Anh Tuyet Grilled Chicken",
            "review_text": "danmo23\n182 contributions\n0\nAmazing chicken - street food style.\nDec 2018 • Couples\nHeart, giblet, tendon, butt, wings, thighs quail, octopus with okra and the list goes on. This place is amazing and was recommended to me by some Aussie Vietnamese now living in Saigon. \n\nLike most good street food in Saigon, you sit on chairs made for preschoolers on the footpath. Don't blink or you'll miss it. \n\nEnjoy!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 23, 2018",
